- The user prefers not to make any code changes until the system is confirmed to be running. (ID: 6505661)
- The user prefers that the assistant present information in an easy-to-read format rather than as one giant sentence. (ID: 6505643)
- The user has granted the assistant full permissions to make necessary code changes and system modifications to ensure the system's success. (ID: 99999999)














